                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0497ae7d-3f8a-37e8-99ac-c222aa4e24cc",
                        "entry_id": "ffbc787f-c948-3b14-960c-03b95e35b332",
                        "glosses": [
                            "разг. прилечь, заснуть (обычно ненадолго), прислонившись к чему-либо"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7293dc2c-89ef-4167-a628-219d61986fa4",
                                "sense_id": "0497ae7d-3f8a-37e8-99ac-c222aa4e24cc",
                                "text": "Возможно, он все же отдыхает где-нибудь днем, а может, ему под утро разрешают прикорнуть на часок-другой."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "90521cc4-b0ac-4e15-80a7-4e4856b9bf9c",
                        "source_entry_id": "ffbc787f-c948-3b14-960c-03b95e35b332",
                        "source_sense_id": "0497ae7d-3f8a-37e8-99ac-c222aa4e24cc",
                        "target_lang_word": "catch a little sleep",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "8d21d5c0-7d72-4664-b6c3-6db02061916e",
                        "source_entry_id": "ffbc787f-c948-3b14-960c-03b95e35b332",
                        "source_sense_id": "0497ae7d-3f8a-37e8-99ac-c222aa4e24cc",
                        "target_lang_word": "nestle",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "nestle",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8ecdd0a0-759a-3af0-ba78-02248fa4543b",
                                        "entry_id": "f99bc10b-07f7-3009-abd4-d1e57fcc1506",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To settle oneself comfortably and snugly."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d8ad9588-2311-47c5-9173-ec9831073bbd",
                                                "sense_id": "8ecdd0a0-759a-3af0-ba78-02248fa4543b",
                                                "text": "In the work that it [the Servants of India Society] will do in the future it will be the spirit of Mr. [Gopal Krishna] Gokhale that will inspire it. So I would remind you that while you raise a statue to his public honour, do not forget what matters more, the hope that ever nestled warmly in his heart, that is nearest and dearest to those who imitate him, throwing away everything of this world and burning upon the altar of their country in sacrifice all that the world could give of joy and wealth, […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c11a9ba8-fa9b-3a4f-ad2c-4912096957c0",
                                        "entry_id": "f99bc10b-07f7-3009-abd4-d1e57fcc1506",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To press oneself against another affectionately."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7ba715ca-fbee-350d-a31d-7aa2ddbc9c30",
                                        "entry_id": "f99bc10b-07f7-3009-abd4-d1e57fcc1506",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To lie half-hidden or in shelter."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ae3c54fe-42f8-42a1-9b3b-4dbd42dc8aea",
                                                "sense_id": "7ba715ca-fbee-350d-a31d-7aa2ddbc9c30",
                                                "text": "The old shop nestled between the newer apartment buildings."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "af5e5453-096f-459c-bd35-c6c04dda4b72",
                                                "sense_id": "7ba715ca-fbee-350d-a31d-7aa2ddbc9c30",
                                                "text": "Their purpose was to fortify in some strong place of the wild and desolate country, and there to nestle till greater succours came."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3b6c98f6-1e47-39a4-bf15-369aa4a57721",
                                        "entry_id": "f99bc10b-07f7-3009-abd4-d1e57fcc1506",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To build or sit upon a nest."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "archaic",
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3848e3b4-f329-48f0-a4a2-27e28b4c8cee",
                                                "sense_id": "3b6c98f6-1e47-39a4-bf15-369aa4a57721",
                                                "text": "The kingfisher […] nestles in hollow banks."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6276ae42-751f-3764-99bf-a21bb866b5fd",
                                        "entry_id": "f99bc10b-07f7-3009-abd4-d1e57fcc1506",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of a bird: to look after its young."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "archaic",
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bdcf06c6-da54-4338-b7a7-8b06c0199f88",
                                                "sense_id": "6276ae42-751f-3764-99bf-a21bb866b5fd",
                                                "text": "This assimilates them more nearly to the natural conditions when the hen nestles her chicks on the earth, whilst the warmth is given chiefly over their backs."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "60549045-b5b5-3e80-bdd6-e6bcc2b9d294",
                                        "entry_id": "f99bc10b-07f7-3009-abd4-d1e57fcc1506",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To move or place into a comfortable position"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f6277019-a66d-42fe-b482-59c6266c771f",
                                                "sense_id": "60549045-b5b5-3e80-bdd6-e6bcc2b9d294",
                                                "text": "She made no answer, but her fingers nervously nestled the leaves of a book."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2c6755b9-8c53-468f-8b81-532d9e01c75a",
                                                "sense_id": "60549045-b5b5-3e80-bdd6-e6bcc2b9d294",
                                                "text": "With as little of movement as possible, Aeon nestled her head closer to his chest, even more inder his chin."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "d04e7f25-88fa-434f-a55b-b7a673161863",
                        "source_entry_id": "ffbc787f-c948-3b14-960c-03b95e35b332",
                        "source_sense_id": "0497ae7d-3f8a-37e8-99ac-c222aa4e24cc",
                        "target_lang_word": "cuddle up",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "cuddle up",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "efe7d286-5b37-30bc-a682-cc594f4defc1",
                                        "entry_id": "69496b2d-ac76-342d-b91b-b0671e8930ef",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To lie or sit in a comfortable, relaxed position, especially holding someone else."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "de7eba8f-113d-4946-b802-612ce4d9ac19",
                                                "sense_id": "efe7d286-5b37-30bc-a682-cc594f4defc1",
                                                "text": "Cuddle up baby, move in tight. We'll go dancing tomorrow night."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "7eb39d5e-b075-4941-8989-f7bbeb27c474",
                        "source_entry_id": "ffbc787f-c948-3b14-960c-03b95e35b332",
                        "source_sense_id": "0497ae7d-3f8a-37e8-99ac-c222aa4e24cc",
                        "target_lang_word": "snuggle",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "snuggle",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "519d729e-3d89-32ed-98b4-2758d1814f30",
                                        "entry_id": "04082607-6ea8-3ffc-b938-7c16a2eecda4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An affectionate hug."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f0f293c3-20b6-45cd-b489-50ec7ac43f24",
                                                "sense_id": "519d729e-3d89-32ed-98b4-2758d1814f30",
                                                "text": "Let's have a snuggle on the sofa."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "74894c04-367a-3d27-b9f8-f2fe62c7b901",
                                        "entry_id": "04082607-6ea8-3ffc-b938-7c16a2eecda4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The final remnant left in a liquor bottle."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "snuggle",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a61e4bc7-27ae-3711-8476-bebd6584ba44",
                                        "entry_id": "655022d8-1e09-325a-8397-c1b4fa213632",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To lie close to another person or thing, hugging or being cosy."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive",
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f0c4afd9-7217-4a75-9021-ebfb7befcd9b",
                                                "sense_id": "a61e4bc7-27ae-3711-8476-bebd6584ba44",
                                                "text": "My girlfriend and I love to snuggle."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "eb8d35b1-bfb1-4162-ae7b-5b16aee47650",
                                                "sense_id": "a61e4bc7-27ae-3711-8476-bebd6584ba44",
                                                "text": "The last drop of jager snuggled the corner of the pint."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f39f4a48-d9d8-41a0-90d7-a1a23ad1ccba",
                                                "sense_id": "a61e4bc7-27ae-3711-8476-bebd6584ba44",
                                                "text": "The surrounding buildings snuggled each other."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2aaf6196-1a5b-4372-a831-21a5a2de367e",
                                                "sense_id": "a61e4bc7-27ae-3711-8476-bebd6584ba44",
                                                "text": "And when the Boy dropped off to sleep, the Rabbit would snuggle down close under his little warm chin and dream, with the Boy's hands clasped close round him all night long."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fbf10b3b-6601-4f05-a192-6c03330f5bb7",
                                                "sense_id": "a61e4bc7-27ae-3711-8476-bebd6584ba44",
                                                "text": "I certainly was not prepared for the cosy nestling valleys that snuggled against the shoulders of the hills; a land where the graystone cottages and farmsteads still prevailed, but where they had taken on something of the softness of their kind in Gloucester and the Cotswolds, and seemed almost like growths of the soil; […]."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2aa84c38-c25b-3be2-af94-00615b082fef",
                                        "entry_id": "655022d8-1e09-325a-8397-c1b4fa213632",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To move or arrange oneself in a comfortable and cosy position."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "da7983c5-a28c-4a84-879d-ccfa3f82674c",
                                                "sense_id": "2aa84c38-c25b-3be2-af94-00615b082fef",
                                                "text": "Tired but satisfied, the children snuggled into their sleeping bags."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f4e25019-382a-440a-9238-b31de7288f3c",
                                                "sense_id": "2aa84c38-c25b-3be2-af94-00615b082fef",
                                                "text": "The pet dog snuggles into its new bed."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
